# Trademark Keyword Monitoring — 4-Agent Hermes Team

## DataForSEO API Credentials (REQUIRED)
# Get from: https://app.dataforseo.com/api
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN=your_email@example.com
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD=your_dataforseo_password

## Trademark & Competitor Lists (REQUIRED)
# Comma-separated, no spaces
TRADEMARK_LIST=loanstart,fastcash,quickbucks
COMPETITOR_LIST=lendify.com,creditmax.com,rapidloan.com

## Approved Advertisers (for AEGIS)
# Domains we own or partner with (AEGIS will alert on all others)
APPROVED_ADVERTISERS=our-domain.com,our-partner1.com,our-partner2.com

## Telegram Alerts (OPTIONAL)
# Get from BotFather on Telegram: https://t.me/BotFather
# If not set, alerts will be logged locally only

# AEGIS — Brand-Jack Detection (every 2 hours)
AEGIS_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id
AEGIS_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token

# SCOUT — Competitor Ad Copy (daily 06:00)
SCOUT_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id
SCOUT_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token

# HERALD — Trend & Reputation (daily 08:00)
HERALD_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id
HERALD_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token

# ORACLE — Keyword Discovery (weekly Monday 09:00)
ORACLE_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id
ORACLE_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token
